##  Secrets & Credentials

## jenkins Pipeline -- Using Credentials
you will learn how to **use credentails securely in Jenkins**

pipeline {
    agent any
    environment {
        INSTITUTE_NAME = "Pathnex"
    }

stages {
    stage('Checkout') {
        steps {
            git url: 'https://github.com/Pathnex/sample-java-app.git'
        }
    }
    stage('USer Secret') {
        steps {
            withCredentials([
                string(
                    credentialsId: 'PATHENX_API_KEY',
                    variable: 'API_KEY'
                )
            ]) {
                sh 'echo "Using secret $API_KEY for $INSTITUTE_NAME"'
            }
        }
    }
}
}

## GitLab CI -- Using CI/CD Variables

stages: 
  - build

variables:
  INSTITUTE_NAME: "Pathnex"
